{
  "url": "https://www.beatlesbible.com/2026/03/12/beatles-memorabilia-jim-irsay-collection-sells-for-over-17-million/",
  "type": "history",
  "slug": "beatles-memorabilia-jim-irsay-collection-sells-for-over-17-million",
  "title": "Beatles memorabilia in Jim Irsay collection sells for over $17 million | 2026",
  "date": "2026-03-12",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>The piano used by <a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a> to compose songs on <a href=\"/albums/sgt-peppers-lonely-hearts-club-band/\"><em>Sgt Pepper’s Lonely Hearts Club Band</em></a> has sold at auction for $3,247,000. <span id=\"more-137143\"></span></p><p>It was part of the collection of Jim Irsay, who died in May 2025 aged 65. Irsay was a US billionaire who owned the Indianapolis Colts American football team, and was worth an estimated $4.8 billion.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/musical-instruments/john-lennon-broadwood-upright-piano_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-137151\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iNzczIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgODAwIDc3MyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"137151\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/musical-instruments/john-lennon-broadwood-upright-piano_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-broadwood-upright-piano_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"3200,3093\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John Lennon&amp;#8217;s Broadwood upright piano\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-broadwood-upright-piano_01-960x928.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/john-lennon-broadwood-upright-piano_01-960x928.jpg\" alt=\"John Lennon's Broadwood upright piano\" width=\"800\" height=\"773\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-137151\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-broadwood-upright-piano_01-960x928.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-broadwood-upright-piano_01-580x561.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-broadwood-upright-piano_01-200x193.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-broadwood-upright-piano_01-768x742.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-broadwood-upright-piano_01-1536x1485.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-broadwood-upright-piano_01-2048x1980.jpg 2048w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"></a></p><p>Irsay amassed an extensive and hugely valuable collection of pop memorabilia objects, including guitars previously owned by John Lennon, Paul McCartney, George Harrison, Eric Clapton, Prince, Kurt Cobain, David Gilmour, Les Paul, and Bob Dylan. In 2017 he paid $2.2 million for a Ludwig drum kit belonging to <a href=\"/people/ringo-starr/\">Ringo Starr</a>.</p><p>Lennon’s Victorian Broadwood upright piano was used to compose songs including <a href=\"/songs/a-day-in-the-life/\">‘A Day In The Life’</a> and <a href=\"/songs/lucy-in-the-sky-with-diamonds/\">‘Lucy In The Sky With Diamonds’</a>. It was the most expensive Beatles-related item in the auction.</p><p>Other items included <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a>’s handwritten lyrics for <a href=\"/songs/hey-jude/\">‘Hey Jude’</a>, which fetched $1.016 million, and those for <a href=\"/songs/maxwells-silver-hammer/\">‘Maxwell’s Silver Hammer’</a>, which sold for $53,340. A Yamaha bass guitar used by McCartney from 1979 to 1984 sold for $228,600, and a Höfner bass guitar signed by him sold for $19,050.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/2026/03/12/beatles-memorabilia-jim-irsay-collection-sells-for-over-17-million/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-137143 gallery-columns-2 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/lyrics/lyrics-maxwells-silver-hammer_03/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTI0IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"124\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-maxwells-silver-hammer_03-124x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul McCartney's handwritten lyrics for Maxwell's Silver Hammer\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-maxwells-silver-hammer_03-124x200.jpg 124w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-maxwells-silver-hammer_03-361x580.jpg 361w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-maxwells-silver-hammer_03-597x960.jpg 597w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-maxwells-silver-hammer_03-768x1234.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-maxwells-silver-hammer_03-956x1536.jpg 956w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-maxwells-silver-hammer_03-1274x2048.jpg 1274w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-maxwells-silver-hammer_03.jpg 1991w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 124px) 100vw, 124px\" data-attachment-id=\"137154\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/lyrics/lyrics-maxwells-silver-hammer_03/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-maxwells-silver-hammer_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1991,3200\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney&amp;#8217;s handwritten lyrics for Maxwell&amp;#8217;s Silver Hammer\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-maxwells-silver-hammer_03-597x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/lyrics/lyrics-hey-jude_02/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMjciIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTI3IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"127\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_02-127x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul McCartney's handwritten lyrics for Hey Jude\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_02-127x200.jpg 127w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_02-368x580.jpg 368w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_02-610x960.jpg 610w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_02-768x1209.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_02-975x1536.jpg 975w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_02-1300x2048.jpg 1300w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_02-scaled.jpg 1626w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 127px) 100vw, 127px\" data-attachment-id=\"108813\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/lyrics/lyrics-hey-jude_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_02-scaled.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1626,2560\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney&amp;#8217;s handwritten lyrics for Hey Jude\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_02-610x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>The drum head used on <a href=\"/people/ringo-starr/\">Ringo Starr</a>’s kit for The Beatles first <em>Ed Sullivan Show</em> appearance in 1964 sold for $2.881 million, and Starr’s Ludwig drum kit used from May 1963 to February 1964 fetched $2.393 million. A pinky ring worn by Starr during the Beatlemania years sold for $120,650, and the snare drum from his second Ludwig kit fetched $92,250.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/2026/03/12/beatles-memorabilia-jim-irsay-collection-sells-for-over-17-million/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-2\" class=\"gallery galleryid-137143 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/musical-instruments/ringo-starr-drop-t-logo-2_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-drop-t-logo-2_01-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Ringo Starr's drop-T drum head number two\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-drop-t-logo-2_01-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-drop-t-logo-2_01-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-drop-t-logo-2_01-960x960.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-drop-t-logo-2_01-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-drop-t-logo-2_01-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-drop-t-logo-2_01-2048x2048.jpg 2048w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"137163\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/musical-instruments/ringo-starr-drop-t-logo-2_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-drop-t-logo-2_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"3200,3200\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Ringo Starr&amp;#8217;s drop-T drum head number two\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-drop-t-logo-2_01-960x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/musical-instruments/ringo-starr-ludwig-drum-kit-1964_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-ludwig-drum-kit-1964_01-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Ringo Starr's 1964 Ludwig drum kit\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-ludwig-drum-kit-1964_01-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-ludwig-drum-kit-1964_01-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-ludwig-drum-kit-1964_01-960x960.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-ludwig-drum-kit-1964_01-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-ludwig-drum-kit-1964_01-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-ludwig-drum-kit-1964_01-2048x2048.jpg 2048w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"137156\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/musical-instruments/ringo-starr-ludwig-drum-kit-1964_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-ludwig-drum-kit-1964_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"3200,3200\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Ringo Starr&amp;#8217;s 1964 Ludwig drum kit\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/ringo-starr-ludwig-drum-kit-1964_01-960x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/musical-instruments/ringo-starr-ludwig-drum-kit-1964_02/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAw