ata-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-gibson-sg-guitar_01-113x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"George Harrison's Gibson SG guitar\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-gibson-sg-guitar_01-113x200.jpg 113w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-gibson-sg-guitar_01-326x580.jpg 326w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-gibson-sg-guitar_01-540x960.jpg 540w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-gibson-sg-guitar_01-768x1365.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-gibson-sg-guitar_01-864x1536.jpg 864w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-gibson-sg-guitar_01-1152x2048.jpg 1152w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-gibson-sg-guitar_01.jpg 1800w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 113px) 100vw, 113px\" data-attachment-id=\"137148\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/musical-instruments/george-harrison-gibson-sg-guitar_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-gibson-sg-guitar_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1800,3200\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"George Harrison&amp;#8217;s Gibson SG guitar\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-gibson-sg-guitar_01-540x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/musical-instruments/vox-kensington-prototype-guitar_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMTMiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTEzIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"113\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/vox-kensington-prototype-guitar_01-113x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles' prototype Vox Kensington guitar\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/vox-kensington-prototype-guitar_01-113x200.jpg 113w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/vox-kensington-prototype-guitar_01-326x580.jpg 326w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/vox-kensington-prototype-guitar_01-540x960.jpg 540w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/vox-kensington-prototype-guitar_01-768x1365.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/vox-kensington-prototype-guitar_01-864x1536.jpg 864w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/vox-kensington-prototype-guitar_01-1152x2048.jpg 1152w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/vox-kensington-prototype-guitar_01.jpg 1800w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 113px) 100vw, 113px\" data-attachment-id=\"137162\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/musical-instruments/vox-kensington-prototype-guitar_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/vox-kensington-prototype-guitar_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1800,3200\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles&amp;#8217; prototype Vox Kensington guitar\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/vox-kensington-prototype-guitar_01-540x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/musical-instruments/george-harrison-maton-mastersound-guitar_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMTMiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTEzIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"113\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-maton-mastersound-guitar_01-113x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"George Harrison's Maton Mastersound guitar\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-maton-mastersound-guitar_01-113x200.jpg 113w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-maton-mastersound-guitar_01-326x580.jpg 326w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-maton-mastersound-guitar_01-540x960.jpg 540w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-maton-mastersound-guitar_01-768x1365.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-maton-mastersound-guitar_01-864x1536.jpg 864w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-maton-mastersound-guitar_01-1152x2048.jpg 1152w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-maton-mastersound-guitar_01.jpg 1800w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 113px) 100vw, 113px\" data-attachment-id=\"137149\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/musical-instruments/george-harrison-maton-mastersound-guitar_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-maton-mastersound-guitar_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1800,3200\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"George Harrison&amp;#8217;s Maton Mastersound guitar\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/george-harrison-maton-mastersound-guitar_01-540x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>Other Beatles items included a signed poster from 1967 ($177,800), a signed photograph from 1963 ($60,950), an affidavit filed by McCartney to break up The Beatles, annotated by Lennon ($165,100), a RIAA gold disc for <a href=\"/songs/i-want-to-hold-your-hand/\">‘I Want To Hold Your Hand’</a> ($158,750), a signed Liverpool Airport sign ($40,640), a 1967 letter by Lennon about Transcendental Meditation ($40,640), two unused Shea Stadium tickets from 1966 (16,510), a set of autographs ($11,430), Brian Epstein’s business card ($11,430), a signed 1962 publicity card ($10,795), a 1977 postcard sent by Lennon ($10,795), a signed Cavern Club membership card ($8,225), an umpire’s locker used during the 1965 Shea Stadium show ($7,620), a 1969 letter from Lennon to his aunt and uncle ($7,620), a 1966 Shea Stadium ticket stub ($4,826), a signed newspaper clipping from 1962 ($4,064), an unused 1966 ticket for Suffolk Downs concert ($3,048), autographs of McCartney and Harrison ($3,048), an unused 1964 ticket for Indiana State Fair concert ($2,794)</p><p>The Jim Irsay Collection was sold by Christie’s in New York. The sale also included David Gilmour’s black Fender Stratocaster, as used on a number of Pink Floyd recordings, which fetched a record-breaking $14.5 million.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/2026/03/12/beatles-memorabilia-jim-irsay-collection-sells-for-over-17-million/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-4\" class=\"gallery galleryid-137143 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/live/640903-ticket-indiana-state-fair_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTA1IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEwNSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"105\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640903-ticket-indiana-state-fair_01-200x105.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Ticket for The Beatles at Indiana State Fair Coliseum, 3 September 1964\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640903-ticket-indiana-state-fair_01-200x105.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640903-ticket-indiana-state-fair_01-580x304.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640903-ticket-indiana-state-fair_01-960x503.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640903-ticket-indiana-state-fair_01-768x402.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640903-ticket-indiana-state-fair_01-1536x804.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640903-ticket-indiana-state-fair_01-2048x1073.jpg 2048w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"137144\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/live/640903-ticket-indiana-state-fair_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640903-ticket-indiana-state-fair_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"3200,1676\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Ticket for The Beatles at Indiana State Fair Coliseum, 3 September 1964\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640903-ticket-indiana-state-fair_01-960x503.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/live/650815-tickets-shea-stadium_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTExIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDExMSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"111\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650815-tickets-shea-stadium_01-200x111.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Tickets for The Beatles at Shea Stadium, New York, 15 August 1965\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650815-tickets-shea-stadium_01-200x111.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650815-tickets-shea-stadium_01-580x323.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650815-tickets-shea-stadium_01-960x534.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650815-tickets-shea-stadium_01-768x427.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650815-tickets-shea-stadium_01-1536x855.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650815-tickets-shea-stadium_01-20